    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\deg (\\mathrm{T} _ {\\mathrm{l}}) := \\frac {1}{\\ell^ {1 / 2}} \\sum_ {0 \\leqslant k \\leqslant \\frac {n}{2}} \\gamma_ {n - 2 k} = \\ell^ {1 / 2} \\frac {\\zeta_ {F _ {\\mathrm{p}}} (1)}{\\zeta_ {F _ {\\mathrm{p}}} (n + 1)} \\leqslant \\ell^ {1 / 2} \\zeta_ {F _ {\\mathrm{p}}} (1). \\tag {5.6}\n\\]"
