    "angle": 0,
    "content": "Since \\(\\pi_2\\) is \\(\\theta_2\\)-tempered at all the finite places, we have \\(|\\lambda_{\\pi_2}(\\mathfrak{q})| \\leqslant (m + 1) \\cdot q^{\\theta_2}\\). Applying Cauchy-Schwartz inequality,",
